- [Advanced Configuration](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticbeanstalk/latest/dg/create_deploy_NET-linux.advanced-otions.md): Configure your Elastic Beanstalk environment with AWS Toolkit for Visual Studio
- [Containers](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticbeanstalk/latest/dg/create_deploy_NET-linux.container.md): Configure your Elastic Beanstalk environment variables as properties for your .NET Core on Linux application with the AWS Toolkit for Visual Studio.
